 1947 until 1964, and from 1966 until 1969. He is widely regarded as one of the greatest defencemen ever to play the game, winning the James Norris Memorial Trophy as the league's top defenceman seven times. In 2017 Harvey was named one of the '100 Greatest NHL Players' in history. Harvey played minor league hockey in Oxford Park, Notre Dame de Grace in his native Montreal, Quebec, Canada, then began his\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d01\", \"text\": \"the Baseball Hall of Fame. In 1999, the Society for American Baseball Research ranked Harvey as the second-greatest umpire in history, behind only Bill Klem. In 2007, \\\"Referee\\\" magazine selected him as one of the 52 most influential figures in the history of sports officiating. Harvey wore uniform number 8 for most of his career. Harvey was born on March 13, 1930, in South Gate, California, but was raised in San Diego, California. Harvey began officiating local basketball games at the high school level at age 16, later umpiring softball and baseball. He attended San Diego State College in 1955-56,\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d02\", \"text\": \"The silver hair , the methodical-yet-authoritative signals . A presence that earned him the nickname “ god. ” Tune in to a high-profile Major League Baseball game in the 1970s or 1980s , and No . 8 – Doug Harvey – was likely to be behind the plate . “ You always respected him because he came out to his job and ( did it ) with a lot of class , ” said Dodgers manager Joe Torre , who – in Harvey ’ s rookie season of 1962 – became the first player ejected by Harvey . “ He\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d03\", \"text\": \", dies at 87 The Associated Press PUBLISHED : January 14 , 2018 at 10:25 PM MST Categories : Colorado Rockies , Latest Headlines , MLB , News , News Obituaries , Sports In this Oct. 11 , 1980 , file photo , plate umpire Doug Harvey gestures before play resumes in the fourth inning of a baseball game between the Astros and Phillies in Houston . Harvey , one of 10 umpires enshrined in the baseball Hall of Fame , died Saturday , Jan. 13 , 2018 . He was 87 . VISALIA , Calif. — Doug Harvey was\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d04\", \"text\": \", the ump known for a shock of silver hair got standing ovations and gifts as he made his last trips to various cities . `` Doug Harvey set the bar for future umpires . He was revered for his calm demeanor , ability to control the game , knowledge of the strike zone and comprehension of the rules , '' Hall President Jeff Idelson said . `` He umpired with integrity , heart and common sense . '' Harvey grew up a three-sport star in El Centro , a small California town near the Mexican border . Before making\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Ice Hockey\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"Doug Harvey was a legendary NHL defenseman. I am certain of this fact based on general sports history knowledge.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Doug Harvey\", \"scope\": \"sport\", \"claim\": \"Doug Harvey (ice hockey) was a Canadian professional hockey player who played in the National Hockey League (NHL).\", \"answer\": \"ice hockey\", \"quote\": \"Doug Harvey (ice hockey) Douglas Norman Harvey (December 19, 1924 – December 26, 1989) was a Canadian professional hockey player who played in the National Hockey League (NHL) from 1947 until 1964, and from 1966 until 1969.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Doug Harvey\", \"scope\": \"sport associated with\", \"claim\": \"In 1999, the Society for American Baseball Research ranked Harvey as the second-greatest umpire in history, behind only Bill Klem.\", \"answer\": \"baseball\", \"quote\": \"In 1999, the Society for American Baseball Research ranked Harvey as the second-greatest umpire in history, behind only Bill Klem.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Doug Harvey\", \"scope\": \"Sport association\", \"claim\": \"Doug Harvey was a Major League Baseball umpire, as indicated by the reference to him being behind the plate in a high-profile Major League Baseball game.\", \"answer\": \"Major League Baseball\", \"quote\": \"” Tune in to a high-profile Major League Baseball game in the 1970s or 1980s , and No . 8 – Doug Harvey – was likely to be behind the plate .\", \"original_document_number\": 3}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d03\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d03:c0\", \"entity\": \"Doug Harvey\", \"scope\": \"sport association\", \"claim\": \"Doug Harvey is associated with baseball, as he was an umpire enshrined in the baseball Hall of Fame.\", \"answer\": \"baseball\", \"quote\": \"11 , 1980 , file photo , plate umpire Doug Harvey gestures before play resumes in the fourth inning of a baseball game between the Astros and Phillies in Houston . Harvey , one of 10 umpires enshrined in the baseball Hall of Fame , died Saturday , Jan.\", \"original_document_number\": 4}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d04\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0113-fb63d1dfe250:d04:c0\", \"entity\": \"Doug Harvey\", \"scope\": \"umpire\", \"claim\": \"Doug Harvey is an ump known for his knowledge of the strike zone and ability to control the game, which are roles in baseball.\", \"answer\": \"baseball\", \"quote\": \", the ump known for a shock of silver hair got standing ovations and gifts as he made his last trips to various cities . `` Doug Harvey set the bar for future umpires . He was revered for his calm demeanor , ability to control the game , knowledge of the strike zone and comprehension of the rules , '' Hall President Jeff Idelson said . `` He umpired with integrity , heart and common sense .\", \"original_document_number\": 5}], \"fa